{"id":"dormitorio","lemma":"dormitorio","pos":"noun","rank":1989,"glosses":["bedroom (a room in a house, apartment, hotel, or other dwelling where a bed is kept for sleeping)","dormitory"],"ipa":"/doɾmiˈtoɾjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"dormitorios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-dormitorio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ese dormitorio es demasiado chico para nosotros.","en":"This room is too small for us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589882","words":[{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"too much"},{"g":"boy"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"we"}]},{"text":"Mi casa tiene dos dormitorios.","en":"My house has two bedrooms.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590335","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},null]},{"text":"Tom tiene su propio dormitorio.","en":"Tom has his own room.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77898","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"own"},null]},{"text":"Vivimos en una casa con tres dormitorios.","en":"We live in a three-bedroom house.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538113","words":[{"g":"to live","l":"vivir"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"Esa puerta da paso al dormitorio.","en":"The door opens into the bedroom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/634997","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"step, footstep"},{"g":"to the"},null]}]}